<title>USA: Peerless Industrial Group Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Peerless Industrial Group Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended  Nine months ended</p>
<p>				1996	 1995	 1996	1995</p>
<p>					     Pro Forma   Pro Forma</p>
